add('The ciphertext payload is larger than the original file because the implementation serializes file bytes as base64 and then base64-encodes the encrypted payload. This simple format improves inspectability for the assignment but adds roughly 78% expansion for large files before small metadata overhead. A binary streaming container would reduce transfer size and peak memory. The grant path currently fetches the owner object to obtain its envelope, so large-file transfer can influence grant time even though only a 32-byte AES key needs rewrapping.')
